es</strong> and develop a play style that makes you feel powerful.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/a7d1e648393d114af5027c81575ff1f3.avif?t=1744895926\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/68ac5de0f04887bbcf19221e02e88823.avif?t=1744895926\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Weather events</h2>Face the fickle weather of the Skycliffs with <strong>20+ events</strong> that will spice up your fights. Take advantage of the situation and be cautious to avoid the extra danger.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/b34cf51ac76897a67908dbd15941757f.poster.avif?t=1744895926\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/b34cf51ac76897a67908dbd15941757f.webm?t=1744895926\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Meet people</h2>Visit <strong>stores</strong> and take on optional <strong>challenges</strong> that will test your skills and offer useful rewards to ease your journey\u2014or make it worse in case of failure.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/773b3652729a8c2b363110d342d3255e.avif?t=1744895926\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/a96ad46d826eae5bf50a3ec542f3f651.avif?t=1744895926\" /></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1888200/extras/39c2752383e58c97be23c71b381114de.avif?t=1744895926\" /></